  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The establishment of just and equitable socio-economic and political systems in which citizens are able to participate fully and where everyone is able to access basic rights.
1) Research report on Economic Justice produced and disseminated and influences policy formulation
2) Long term advocacy strategy on service delivery developed
3) Knowledge and resource base on Environmental Justice developed
4) Good Governance and Democracy is promoted through STC</narrative>
